          "type": "leverage",
          "limit": 1.0,
          "unit": "x",
          "direction": "min",
          "maintenance": false,
          "text": "“ Level I Status ” exists at any date if, as of the last day of the fiscal quarter of the US Borrower referred to in the most recent Financials, the Leverage Ratio is less than or equal to 1.00 to 1.00."
